      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I believe there is. It really depends on how the operation started by task A reacts when the status bits of the crypto unit are reset by task B in the lines 69-72. Will that cause dcrypto_done_interrupt() be be called before this line is executed by task B? I don\u0027t know how the crypto HW works well enough to answer that questions definitively.",
